=2 Walkthrough
!Updated marked map ceizak battlegrounds.jpeg||Marked map with harvesting locations
* Speak with {n:Pagnelle} (G-10) in {z:Western Adoulin} near Mummers Coalition for a cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Gontrain} (H-12, next to the residential area) for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Pagnelle} for another cutscene.
* Travel to the {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} and obtain three {k:rockberries|Rockberry} by harvesting at a Harvesting Point. The berries are key items and are obtained at random, so bring multiple {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020}. Rockberries will be obtained with priority over normal items, so all rockberries may be obtained at one harvesting point; however, you will still be subject to gathering fatigue. (Sickle pretty much breaks on every harvest.)
** Known harvesting point locations:
*** Intersection of three paths at E/F-8 boundary
*** Intersection of three paths at G/H-8 boundary
*** Far southeast corner of the map
*** Southwest corner at (E-10)
*** Bivouac #3 at (F-9)
*** Northwest corner at (F-6)
* Return to {n:Pagnelle} for another cutscene.
* Travel to the {z:Rala Waterways} (enter from J-12 in {z:Western Adoulin} "Your Rent-a-Room" waypoint) and go to (E-11) near where {n:Relentless Storm} and {n:Jaroney-Baroney} stand on a bridge and close to a door. A cutscene will trigger automatically.
* Return to {n:Pagnelle} to complete the quest.

